<tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:mi_sheberakh/cholah"><tei:pb n="372" ed="1949 shabbat/shacharit/torah" facs="https://archive.org/download/PhilipBirnbaumHaSiddurHaShalemTheDailyPrayerBook1949/page/n396_medium.jpg"/><tei:p><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:mi_sheberakh/cholah/text"/>He who blessed our fathers Abraham, Isaac and Jacob, Moses and Aaron, David and Solomon, may he heal …<tei:note type="instruction" xml:lang="en">The name is given.</tei:note> who is ill. May the Holy One, blessed be he, have mercy and speedily restore her to perfect health, both spiritual and physical; and let us say, Amen. <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/></tei:p></tei:div>
